<p>Gain 5 generic talent points and learn a new talent category from one of the below at 1.0 mastery, unlocked. Group 1 categories are available to anyone; Group 2 are not available to magic users, and Group 3 are not available to antimagic characters.</p><p>GROUP 1:</p><ul><li> Cunning / Scoundrel</li><li> Cunning / Survival</li><li> Technique / Conditioning</li></ul><p></p><p>GROUP 2:</p><ul><li> Psionic / Augmented mobility</li><li> Psionic / Dreaming</li><li> Psionic / Feedback</li><li> Wild-gift / Call of the wild</li><li> Wild-gift / Mindstar mastery</li></ul><p></p><p>GROUP 3:</p><ul><li> Celestial / Chants</li><li> Chronomancy / Chronomancy</li><li> Corruption / Curses</li><li> Spell / Divination</li><li> Spell / Staff combat</li><li> Spell / Stone alchemy</li></ul><p></p>